closed_at":"2026-10-01T15:58:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124042","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124042.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124042.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-01T15:58:29Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #124041\r\n\r\nOn display servers without `FEATURE_MOUSE` (e.g. iOS), the root `Window` prints `Mouse is not supported by this display server.` on every startup. The simulated mouse-enter check in `Window::_notification()` calls `DisplayServer::mouse_get_position()` unconditionally.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis checks `FEATURE_MOUSE` before querying the mouse position, the same way `Viewport::get_mouse_position()` already does. Without a mouse there is nothing to simulate, so skipping the mouse-enter event is the intended behavior.\r\n\r\nNot tested with a rebuilt iOS template yet: the error and its source were confirmed on an iPhone 12 Pro with 4.7.2.stable and the MRP in the linked issue.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124042/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124042/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}